      :purpose "A tracked baseline records suites executed, assertions executed, refutations executed, suites failing and failures by cause, written by the runner itself rather than assembled by hand, and a later run that reduces executed assertions without an explicit decision fails."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
